Licensing rationale (not legal advice)
--------------------------------------
* InTAS (https://github.com/silaslobo/InTAS) is GPL-3.0. This repository does NOT
  redistribute it: data/raw/intas/ is git-ignored and scripts/setup_sumo.sh clones it at a
  pinned commit on the user's machine. Our code only reads InTAS files at runtime and does
  not copy, link against, or embed InTAS code, so Apache-2.0 for our code is compatible.
  (Apache-2.0 code may be combined into GPL-3.0 works; the reverse is not true, so users who
  redistribute a combined work containing InTAS must follow GPL-3.0 for that combined work.)
